  "methodology": "Ensemble of logistic regression, XGBoost and LightGBM over margin-adjusted Elo, rolling team form, Pythagorean expectation, rest and park factors, refit on every game played before the slate date. The three FanGraphs season-aggregate feature groups are excluded: they join end-of-season totals onto in-season games, which leaks the result being predicted. This model has no demonstrated edge -- over the 2026 season it does not beat always picking the home team at any conventional significance level, and its high-confidence picks realize BELOW their stated probability. Published as model output, not as a betting recommendation."
